app/graph_visualizer/frontend/node_modules/
# app/graph_visualizer/frontend/build/ IS shipped (prebuilt React bundle)
# so users don't need Node + npm to use the KG Visualizer. Negate the
# global `build/` rule for this specific path. Without this exception
# the JS bundle silently fails to track and Flask serves a stale ref.
!app/graph_visualizer/frontend/build/
!app/graph_visualizer/frontend/build/**
app/agent_flow/node_modules/

