# ── User-specific runtime data and configs ───────────────────────────────────
# OAuth account definitions — Emi-specific account ids/display names (creds
# themselves are file-path pointers to already-gitignored credentials/*.json).
# Untracked per policy: every Emi-specific thing is gitignored unless a clean
# template exists. NOTE: oauth_registry.py requires this file at startup, so a
# fresh clone must create configs/oauth_accounts.json (no in-repo example yet).
configs/oauth_accounts.json
# Edge-importance calibration eval — fixture of REAL KG edges (real node UUIDs +
# contact facts: phone/email). Personal data; not safe for the public repo. Only
# read by the manually-run `python -m app.assistant.kg.edge_importance_eval`
# script (not app startup, not the test suite), so untracking has no runtime impact.
app/assistant/kg/edge_importance_eval.yaml
